If the type_integer_ param_target_ is found in the type_integer_array_ param_nums_ , the first element of the type_integer_array_ result is equal to the starting position of the param_target_ value in the type_integer_array_ param_nums_ , and the second element of the type_integer_array_ result is equal to the ending position of the param_target_ value in the type_integer_array_ param_nums_ . 
